/Title (Next, consider the target demographic for your campaign and products. Location-aware consumers \(those with mobile devices and familiar with location-based services\) tend to be a younger, more educated, and wealthier demographic. They have many of the same characteristics as all mobile shoppers.)
/Dest [48 0 R /Fit]
